264
00:14:44,980 --> 00:14:47,997
Saw you teamed up with those
losers from the forest, did you?

265
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:52,237
What a joke Now I see how Straw Hat
got that ridiculous increase in power?

266
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:56,980
How desperate you must be to use
my own shadow abilities against me!

267
00:14:57,780 --> 00:14:59,100
You shut your mouth!

268
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,960
Return the shadows at once!

269
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:05,520
Straw Hat Luffy, you've got some
nerve making a mess of Thriller Bark!

270
00:15:08,460 --> 00:15:11,317
You'll pay for what you've
done to my glorious ship!

271
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:12,917
You're the one who's gonna pay!

272
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:15,097
It's your fault for picking
a fight with my crew!

273
00:15:15,180 --> 00:15:18,180
Now get back those shadows
before the sun comes up!

274
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:25,737
Why, when at this point all I have to do
is sit around and wait for you all to die?

275
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:28,437
I'm afraid you're not cut
out for the new world, kid.

276
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:32,226
I admit you've got some good
underlings, but it doesn't matter.

277
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:35,600
All will be lost.

278
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:38,020
And do you know why?

279
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:39,470
Why?

280
00:15:39,553 --> 00:15:42,477
Straw Hat, this isn't exactly the
time to sit around and chit-chat.

281
00:15:42,560 --> 00:15:43,913
Take a look at the sky.

282
00:15:44,020 --> 00:15:44,977
It's getting brighter.

283
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:47,060
Focus on getting the shadows back.

284
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:49,780
We're almost out of time!

285
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:54,361
Because unlike me, you've yet to
realize the weakness of your crew.

286
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,620
They were mortal!

287
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:02,257
That's what makes things
different this time.

288
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:05,817
Had they been zombies from the beginning,
I would have had nothing to lose.

289
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:07,480
Zomnius are fearless,

290
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:12,280
eternal, relentless warriors that can
be replaced even if they fall! Now,

291
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,757
with my army of the undead,

292
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:17,837
there's nothing in the world that will
stop me from becoming king of the pirates!

293
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:22,273
You and your crew should be grateful
for the chance to serve as my slaves!

294
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:35,260
Miss! It's not me!

295
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:51,180
Now, every last shot of Ibrillabark,
come to me and become my power!

296
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,060
SHADOWS! ASCARD!

297
00:16:56,660 --> 00:16:57,860
What's happening?

298
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:02,780
His shadow came out!

299
00:17:08,180 --> 00:17:09,580
Are these shadows?

300
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:10,860
No way!

301
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:15,729
He's gathering up every shadow on this
island and pumping them into his body!

302
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:20,297
Tell me, Straw Hat Luffy,

303
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:23,957
from your strength I'd say you
absorbed about a hundred shadows,

304
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:24,870
right?

305
00:17:30,220 --> 00:17:33,920
Then I shall take one
hundred, two hundred,

306
00:17:34,300 --> 00:17:37,957
three hundred,

307
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:41,137
four hundred,

308
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:45,240
five hundred,

309
00:17:53,320 --> 00:17:54,420
We're screwed!

310
00:17:58,580 --> 00:17:59,677
It's all over.

311
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:02,917
We can't even hide from that thing. Nice.

312
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:03,960
Back to normal.

313
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,637
The sun is rising.

314
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:07,117
It's almost done.

315
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,657
We're out of time.

316
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:15,137
Straw Hat needed a
hundred shadows to take.

317
00:18:15,220 --> 00:18:17,240
There's no way we can defeat him.

318
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:20,027
Not even with devil
fruit powers on our side.

319
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:21,751
Face it, we're all doomed

320
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:26,997
What's the point of even trying?

321
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:29,080
He'll beat us no matter what we do

322
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:34,000
He's got Straw Hats shadow inside him too

323
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,050
Oh, no!

324
00:18:57,380 --> 00:18:59,160
He's wrecking his own ship!

325
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:01,439
We gotta get out of here right now!

326
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:07,410
Run!

327
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:08,780
Run to the forest!

328
00:19:09,260 --> 00:19:10,880
We're never gonna make it!

329
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:12,520
There's no way, man!

330
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:18,780
I'm on fire!

331
00:19:18,940 --> 00:19:20,020
My skin's melting!

332
00:19:20,260 --> 00:19:22,100
Somebody help! Get up!

333
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:23,418
Run for the forest!

334
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:24,817
The sun is coming up!

335
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:26,253
We can't fight anymore.

336
00:19:26,340 --> 00:19:28,105
All we can do is run and hide.

337
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:30,620
Captain Lola!

338
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:32,134
Hey, come on, Captain!

339
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:34,357
Why are you just standing there like that?

340
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,270
Hurry up!

341
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:37,380
You guys can run if you want.

342
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:40,560
What the hell are you saying?

343
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:42,978
The sun will kill you too, you know.

344
00:19:44,300 --> 00:19:48,137
I have to take some
responsibility this battle

345
00:19:48,220 --> 00:19:52,720
it's my fight too look at them do you see?

346
00:19:57,380 --> 00:20:01,940
They're not budging they're
completely fearless!

347
00:20:03,780 --> 00:20:06,097
They're in the same
boat we are they've lost

348
00:20:06,180 --> 00:20:10,780
their shadows too come on you don't
think they? can still win. Yeah, really.

349
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:14,537
They're goners if the sun hits them,
and look at Merde, he's indestructible.

350
00:20:14,620 --> 00:20:16,326
He's even stronger than Orbs.

351
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:22,580
If they won't give up on this fight,
then I'm with them all the way.

352
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,657
I thought our battle
might end up like this,

353
00:20:25,740 --> 00:20:28,557
but I was willing to place my bets
on the Straw Hats all the same,

354
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:31,617
and I don't regret making
that decision one single bit.

355
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:33,837
There's no way we could defeat that thing.

356
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:35,320
Then go ahead and run.

357
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:37,402
It's my job to see this through.

358
00:20:37,780 --> 00:20:38,860
I'm your captain.

359
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:43,980
And as your leader, I want you to be safe.

360
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,660
Captain Lola! Hurry!

361
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:48,957
You're in the sunlight!

362
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,877
You gotta get in the shadows, quick!

363
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,380
I'm fine where I am!

364
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:56,097
This is what it means to
put your faith in someone!

365
00:20:56,180 --> 00:20:57,640
And I won't falter!

366
00:20:58,280 --> 00:20:59,520
Don't do it, Captain!

367
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:00,720
You can't!

368
00:21:01,180 --> 00:21:02,640
You're gonna get killed!

369
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:05,409
I accept whatever fate
has in store for me.

370
00:21:05,520 --> 00:21:07,755
Live or die, that's my final decision!

371
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,160
Here is where I stand.

372
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:12,321
I'm never leaving the light again

373
00:21:13,460 --> 00:21:14,340
No, Captain

374
00:21:17,760 --> 00:21:19,760
This guy is the big boss, right?

375
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,937
Because I don't think
they get much bigger He

376
00:21:22,020 --> 00:21:24,137
let his pride and anger
get the best of him,

377
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:26,514
and now he's losing control of himself.

378
00:21:27,600 --> 00:21:30,320
All right, you guys,
we're almost out of time!

379
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:32,800
I'm gonna have to go wild here.

380
00:21:33,020 --> 00:21:36,600
It's up to you to take care of
the rest You got it, Captain!

381
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:38,275
Take him down, Luffy!

382
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,155
What's with you guys?

383
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:41,737
Are you out of your damn minds?

384
00:21:41,820 --> 00:21:43,644
There's no way we can win here!

385
00:21:43,780 --> 00:21:46,417
He's a monster with the
strength of a thousand people!

386
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:47,330
Exactly!

387
00:21:47,413 --> 00:21:48,243
Think for a minute!

388
00:21:48,326 --> 00:21:50,337
He's got your shadows
trapped in there, too!

389
00:21:50,420 --> 00:21:52,257
Which means he's got your powers!

390
00:21:52,340 --> 00:21:54,417
On top of that, you've
only got a few minutes!

391
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:57,324
Shut your mouth if you're
not gonna help us out!

392
00:21:57,680 --> 00:22:01,640
This battle's already over,
and Moria knows he's lost. Huh?

393
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,760
Our real enemy here is the sun.

394
00:22:04,980 --> 00:22:07,745
In other words, it's a
fight against the clock.

395
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:09,977
Moria sucking in all
those shadows was just

396
00:22:10,060 --> 00:22:12,531
a desperate move to try and buy some time.

397
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:21,300
All right, second gear!

398
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:29,020
Either the sun wipes us out or
Moria destroys himself. Go, Luffy!

399
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:30,420
Take him down!

400
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:47,177
You see that?

401
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:48,880
The shadows are escaping!

402
00:23:01,520 --> 00:23:04,877
It looks like hundreds of
shadows are pouring out!

403
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:06,200
How can they get out?

404
00:23:06,300 --> 00:23:08,157
I thought the shadows
were under his command.

405
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:12,097
Merde is losing consciousness, so he's
losing control of the shadows he stole, too!

406
00:23:12,180 --> 00:23:16,827
Not even he's powerful enough for his
mind to handle that many shadows at once!

407
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:23,720
Gum-Gum! No! Break that!

408
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:34,420
I call that one the black box!

409
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:37,597
Damn it, he trapped me!

410
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:38,960
I'll crush him!

411
00:23:44,280 --> 00:23:45,460
Direct hit.

412
00:23:45,760 --> 00:23:47,937
From the fist that cracked the island.

413
00:23:48,020 --> 00:23:49,200
Straw Hat, no!

414
00:23:54,540 --> 00:23:55,960
Don't do it!

415
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:59,760
Consider this your punishment!

416
00:24:05,080 --> 00:24:07,437
Now you know what happens
to cocky little snorts

417
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:10,402
that think they can sail
into my neck of the sea.

418
00:24:12,060 --> 00:24:16,354
This is the fate of all those who
stand in the way of the seven warlords.

419
00:24:21,420 --> 00:24:24,008
You gotta know your
place in the world, kid.

420
00:24:24,260 --> 00:24:25,740
Nails that stick out.

421
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:29,920
They're only asking to
get hammered back in.

422
00:24:35,520 --> 00:24:37,360
Luffy! Stop it!

423
00:24:51,420 --> 00:24:53,700
A nail that sticks out.

424
00:24:55,980 --> 00:24:58,140
But I'll tell you this.

425
00:25:00,600 --> 00:25:02,277
No one will ever?

426
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:04,480
Hammer me down!

427
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:07,660
You really believe that, don't you?

428
00:25:10,780 --> 00:25:13,820
It's almost impressive
how damn arrogant you are,

429
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:17,720
kid What the hell makes you
think you're so indestructible?

430
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:19,480
As rubber bounces back.

431
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,557
Mark my words!

432
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:29,337
I'm going to make you spit
out all those shadows!

433
00:25:29,420 --> 00:25:30,660
Is this guy for real?

434
00:25:30,820 --> 00:25:31,677
He might do it!

435
00:25:31,760 --> 00:25:32,680
Don't jinx it!

436
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,920
The sun's coming up!

437
00:25:38,260 --> 00:25:41,377
Laura, get back in the shade or
you're going to disintegrate!

438
00:25:41,460 --> 00:25:42,290
Help me!

439
00:25:42,373 --> 00:25:44,640
I'm on fire! Pull back!

440
00:25:44,820 --> 00:25:47,232
We're running out of places to hide here!

441
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:49,840
Third gear!

442
00:26:00,420 --> 00:26:04,597
He's gonna bump it up to third gear what
is he out of his mind you've got to stop!

443
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:06,557
Movie you're going way too far don't you

444
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:09,581
remember what happened the
last time you use that?

445
00:26:19,840 --> 00:26:20,720
Oh, come!

446
00:26:22,740 --> 00:26:23,570
Giant!

447
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:25,510
Shack!

448
00:26:26,120 --> 00:26:26,950
Shack!

449
00:26:31,500 --> 00:26:32,640
Holy crap!

450
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,160
He's leaking shadows!

451
00:26:37,260 --> 00:26:38,677
I'm dying anywhere.

452
00:26:38,760 --> 00:26:40,000
I'm in control here.

453
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:46,117
Listen to me, Shadows.

454
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:48,657
I am your master and you will obey me.

455
00:26:48,740 --> 00:26:50,700
Now get back in there!

456
00:26:51,820 --> 00:26:53,220
That evil bastard!

457
00:26:53,460 --> 00:26:54,797
He's fighting them all back!

458
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:55,998
They can't get out!

459
00:26:56,300 --> 00:26:57,888
Can you hear me, my shadow?

460
00:26:58,980 --> 00:27:00,520
Come back right now!

461
00:27:07,020 --> 00:27:08,600
I'm waiting for you!

462
00:27:08,940 --> 00:27:10,200
Now return to me!

463
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,376
We've been together ever since birth!

464
00:27:15,500 --> 00:27:16,676
We were born as one!

465
00:27:17,500 --> 00:27:19,140
You don't belong to him!

466
00:27:19,340 --> 00:27:20,458
We belong together!

467
00:27:21,020 --> 00:27:22,400
Please return to me!

468
00:27:22,840 --> 00:27:27,337
I've spent three long years searching
for the zombie you were trapped inside!

469
00:27:27,420 --> 00:27:29,538
And now you're right in front of me!

470
00:27:29,860 --> 00:27:32,400
If you can hear my voice, please return!

471
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:33,840
Come back to me!

472
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:34,790
Gabiola!

473
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:38,317
We can't let you stand out
here and destroy yourself!

474
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:40,257
Get in the shade before it's too late!

475
00:27:40,340 --> 00:27:43,037
Come on, don't tell me
you guys can't feel it!

476
00:27:43,120 --> 00:27:44,300
They're right there!

477
00:27:46,660 --> 00:27:47,500
She's right.

478
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:49,120
He's got our shadows.

479
00:27:49,500 --> 00:27:51,777
Every one of them is
inside Morty's stomach.

480
00:27:51,860 --> 00:27:53,497
Not even a hundred feet from us.

481
00:27:53,580 --> 00:27:56,420
If we run, we might
never get another chance.

482
00:27:56,740 --> 00:27:59,080
Still, we can't take on a warlord.

483
00:28:01,960 --> 00:28:04,220
We've got to try. Come back!

484
00:28:04,360 --> 00:28:05,301
Come back to us!

485
00:28:05,580 --> 00:28:06,815
Return home, shadows!

486
00:28:07,080 --> 00:28:13,880
Come back, shadows!

487
00:28:14,900 --> 00:28:16,100
You know what?

488
00:28:16,520 --> 00:28:18,814
I've got some words for my shadow, too!

489
00:28:22,620 --> 00:28:26,444
If you really want to be the shadow
of the King of the Pirates...

490
00:28:28,180 --> 00:28:30,000
...then you better shape up!

491
00:28:30,800 --> 00:28:32,560
And come back, now!

492
00:29:10,940 --> 00:29:14,980
I don't know.

493
00:29:19,180 --> 00:29:21,260
Straw Hat you bastard!

494
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,040
Just you watch!

495
00:29:25,860 --> 00:29:27,960
You think you had it tough so far?

496
00:29:28,180 --> 00:29:29,709
You don't even know tough!

497
00:29:30,040 --> 00:29:34,360
But don't worry, the real nightmare's
waiting for you in the new world!

498
00:29:39,600 --> 00:29:41,000
They're coming back!

499
00:29:41,360 --> 00:29:43,300
They're actually coming back!

500
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:00,830
Hey!

501
00:30:00,913 --> 00:30:02,409
Quick, get down, you guys!

502
00:30:08,500 --> 00:30:09,330
Shadow!

503
00:30:09,620 --> 00:30:10,780
Hurry back to me!

504
00:30:11,100 --> 00:30:12,220
What's going on?

505
00:30:16,740 --> 00:30:19,080
Little baby!
